The build links SDL2 and OpenGL/GLVND when GRACE_ENABLE_OPENGL is enabled,
and the physics SDKs when their GRACE_ENABLE_PHYSX / GRACE_ENABLE_BULLET /
GRACE_ENABLE_BOX2D options are enabled. Entries marked "planned" are
recorded here so that attribution is in place before the dependency is
integrated; their licence texts are added to third_party/ when the
corresponding backend is actually built.

